-# g) Behavior verification metric:
-#    A generated sample is accepted only if the internal diagnostics report at least three collision events,
-#    all four seed beams participate in collisions, and at least three distinct beam pairs interact.
+#    Only two objects are present, both use the same wall color, and the generator rejects weak cases
